# Media-light vendoring for skill packs (stickman precedent): heavy raster/AV/print
# media stays local-only — vendored skills degrade gracefully for clones (disclosed
# in each skill's vendoring note); regenerable outputs re-generate from bundled
# scripts (e.g. anatomy-illustration `sheet.mjs` re-prints the A4 PDFs).
skills/**/*.png
skills/**/*.jpg
skills/**/*.jpeg
skills/**/*.webp
skills/**/*.gif
skills/**/*.avif
skills/**/*.mp4
skills/**/*.mov
skills/**/*.wav
skills/**/*.mp3
skills/**/*.pdf
# Upstream repo metadata vendored along with skill packs (issue/PR templates,
# funding files, social previews) — never part of the skill itself
skills/**/.github/
# Exceptions — small and functionally required:
# theme-factory SKILL.md workflow step 1 requires displaying this PDF
!skills/theme-factory/theme-showcase.pdf
